# What a crawl fetched and what the flows made of it: run `crawl` and `analyze` to rebuild them.
# The catalog's code, the hand-kept blocklist and utilities, the sample seeds and the exported mention graph, which
# the blog copies, are the only data committed: seeds.json is each crawler's own.
Data/**
!Data/**/
!Data/**/*.cs
!Data/_01_Raw/blocklist.csv
!Data/_01_Raw/utilities.csv
!Data/_01_Raw/seeds.sample.json
!Data/_03_Reporting/mention-graph.json
!Data/_03_Reporting/mention-graph.svg
